{"ticker":"NVR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:02:22Z","profile":{"longName":"NVR, Inc.","shortName":"NVR, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Residential Construction","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nvrinc.com","fullTimeEmployees":6300,"marketCap":15957935104,"trailingPE":16.47103,"forwardPE":16.805847,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6951494,"pegRatio":4.97,"targetMeanPrice":6262.0,"targetHighPrice":7425.0,"targetLowPrice":5058.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":6,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.082,"earningsGrowth":-0.204,"grossMargins":0.21099001,"operatingMargins":0.14113,"profitMargins":0.11124,"totalRevenue":9413880832,"beta":0.902,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":8200.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":5501.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"NVR, Inc. operates as a homebuilder in the United States. The company operates through Homebuilding and Mortgage Banking segments. It engages in the construction and sale of single-family detached homes, townhomes, and condominium buildings under the Ryan Homes, NVHomes, and Heartland Homes names. The company markets its Ryan Homes products to first-time and first-time move-up buyers; and NVHomes and Heartland Homes products to move-up and luxury buyers. It also provides various mortgage related services to its homebuilding customers, as well as brokers title insurance; performs title searches; and sells mortgage loans to investors in the secondary markets on a servicing released basis. The company primarily serves Maryland, Virginia, West Virginia, Delaware, Washington, D.C., New Jersey, Eastern Pennsylvania, New York, Ohio, Western Pennsylvania, Indiana, Illinois, North Carolina, South Carolina, Tennessee, Florida, Georgia, and Kentucky. NVR, Inc. was founded in 1948 and is headquartered in Reston, Virginia.","summary_zh":"NVR, Inc. 在美國以住宅建築商經營。該公司透過住宅建築和抵押銀行業務部門運作。該公司以 Ryan Homes、NVHomes 和 Heartland Homes 名義從事單戶獨立住宅、聯排別墅和公寓大樓的建設和銷售。該公司向首次購屋者和首次搬家的買家推銷其 Ryan Homes 產品；以及 NVHomes 和 Heartland Homes 產品，面向升級和豪華買家。它還為其住宅建築客戶提供各種抵押貸款相關服務以及經紀人產權保險；執行產權搜尋；並在二級市場上向投資者出售抵押貸款以釋放服務。該公司主要為馬裡蘭州、維吉尼亞州、西維吉尼亞州、德拉瓦州、華盛頓特區、新澤西州、賓州東部、紐約州、俄亥俄州、賓州西部、印第安納州、伊利諾州、北卡羅來納州、南卡羅來納州、田納西州、佛羅裡達州、喬治亞州和肯塔基州提供服務。 NVR, Inc. 成立於 1948 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州雷斯頓。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"住宅建設","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":8027.5298,"h":8195.0,"l":8027.5298,"c":8169.8501,"v":18500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":8148.8799,"h":8287.79,"l":8148.8799,"c":8190.23,"v":15700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":8300.0,"h":8409.3398,"l":8204.9004,"c":8407.7695,"v":17700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":8499.7598,"h":8618.2803,"l":8442.1104,"c":8502.0,"v":13300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":8509.4004,"h":8562.5,"l":8420.9004,"c":8543.0,"v":15200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":8459.9805,"h":8475.0,"l":8217.4902,"c":8276.25,"v":22200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":8245.6602,"h":8335.8896,"l":8225.46,"c":8335.8896,"v":21900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":8384.3096,"h":8563.79,"l":8344.0498,"c":8532.9805,"v":22400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":8506.3496,"h":8544.3896,"l":8377.6299,"c":8414.8203,"v":15900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":8422.0,"h":8489.8496,"l":8207.5703,"c":8277.9502,"v":17400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":8277.0996,"h":8282.9102,"l":8127.8501,"c":8209.9805,"v":17100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":8240.0098,"h":8429.9902,"l":8090.0,"c":8137.3101,"v":19500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":8190.0,"h":8192.5596,"l":8055.0,"c":8178.48,"v":21600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":8135.4399,"h":8200.0098,"l":8077.7202,"c":8094.7002,"v":45300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":8067.0,"h":8067.0,"l":7907.3198,"c":7925.23,"v":19900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":7950.0,"h":8016.0898,"l":7900.3398,"c":7980.1099,"v":12000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":7915.02,"h":8098.0,"l":7915.02,"c":8036.6299,"v":22200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":7993.8599,"h":8025.3198,"l":7906.52,"c":7906.6899,"v":14200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":7953.8701,"h":8069.71,"l":7921.6899,"c":8032.7798,"v":12100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":8100.0,"h":8113.1602,"l":7981.0698,"c":8095.1401,"v":14200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":8040.75,"h":8075.0,"l":7998.9502,"c":80